	(text_box "add USB BATTERY CHARGER, for example BQ24040. this will generate a 4.2V voltage rail. the 4.2 voltage rail is then dcdc converted to 1.8V (e.g. U1) to supply the entirety of the WIFI PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.29 -10.16 0)
		(size 49.53 30.48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
