	(text_box "Check power supply sequencing for SI chip: can the 1.8 turn on at the same time as 3.3? not a problem with the graphs.\nthe problem is if we want to control the LD_EN with the mcu. at start the siwg can't work properly so can't use it.\nthe VBATT of the mcu must be high with the other supply or the first one, but can be later"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 39.37 0)
